        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-K4014, Solid Brass 6-1/8\" Regency Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Regency Door Knocker is beautiful with strong roots in historical design. It is made out of solid brass and available in a wide array of stunning finishes including all of the most popular like polished nickel and oil rubbed bronze. The Regency Knocker is 6-1/8 inches tall with a 4-1/4 inch center to center. Add charm to your front door with this elegant knocker.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Regency Front Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
